ce — what retrieval actually needs is relevance, and relevance requires reasoning. On professional documents that demand contextual understanding, domain expertise, and multi-step reasoning, similarity search misses what is relevant but not similar, and returns what is similar but not relevant.","Inspired by AlphaGo, PageIndex replaces the vector index with a hierarchical tree index and lets an LLM reason its way through it, the way a human expert turns to and reads the right section of a long report. Retrieval happens in two steps:"],"features":["Index: generate a tree-structure index for each document","Retrieve: agentically search that tree with LLM reasoning"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"af6c8a70730572d114e9d1abae561a8419522fd23bbfb9a6b14c81f50960df43","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:44.399Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:44.399Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T11:34:06Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://calendly.com/pageindex/meet","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:50.489Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:50.489Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:50.489Z","target":"https://calendly.com/pageindex/meet?month=2026-10","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-26T14:06:50.489Z","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"probeVersion":3},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:50.490Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Reasoning-based RAG ◦ No Vector DB, No Chunking ◦ Context-Aware Retrieval ◦ Reads Like a Human","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Moving indexing and storage from Local to Cloud only requires a PageIndex API key:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"af6c8a70730572d114e9d1abae561a8419522fd23bbfb9a6b14c81f50960df43","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt"